40
00:03:48,000 --> 00:04:03,000
So I can imagine any number of different ways this requirement could be fulfilled in and out of scouting, because there's nothing that says that that development has to be done exclusively as a part of the scouting experience.

41
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:13,000
We definitely want our scouts, especially our Eagle Scouts, out there spreading the knowledge and using the skills that they've obtained in scouting.

42
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:16,000
So if you've got a different take on that, I'd love to hear about it.

43
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:25,000
Or if you've ever seen any verbiage- official verbiage- about that requirement- it was a new question to me. How about that? huh

